<title>USA: CrossComm Corp Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>CrossComm Corp Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>							  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						     March 31,   March 31,</p>
<p>							   1997	  1996</p>
<p>Revenues					    $11,803	$10,658</p>
<p>Total operating expenses			  6,299	  7,062</p>
<p>Income (loss) from operations		    (17)	(2,089)</p>
<p>Interest income, net				  458	    538</p>
<p>Other income (expense)			     (83)	   (43)</p>
<p>Income (loss) before provision</p>
<p>     for income taxes				358	 (1,594)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)				   $358	($1,594)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share			 $0.04	($0.17)</p>
<p>Shares used in computing earnings</p>
<p>     (loss) per share			     9,860	  9,150</p>
<p>NOTE: CrossComm Corp said operating income for the current quarter excludes non-recurring charges related to the impending sale of the company to Olicom A/S.</p>
